<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bank sets warrants on Hopewell.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank sets warrants on Hopewell.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG said on Tuesday it intended to issue 420 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hopewell Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$4.815	  PREMIUM	  14.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.1311	 GEARING	  4.08X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  25.NOV.97	 PAYDATE	  6.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	 LISTING DATE   11.DEC.96</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$5.35</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
